==German==

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|de|gmh|[[hōchzīt]], [[hōchgezīt]]}}, from {{m|goh|hōha gezīt||high celebration}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|/ˈhɔxt͡saɪt/|lang=de}}

====Noun====
{{de-noun|f}}

# [[wedding]] {{gloss|a ceremony in which people are married and/or a celebration thereof}}
#: {{ux|de|Die '''Hochzeit''' der Oscar-Preisträgerin war tagelang Hauptthema in der Klatschpresse.|The Oscar award winner’s '''wedding''' was the main topic of the yellow press for days.}}

